==Korean==

===Etymology===
From {{ko-l|이|this}} + {{ko-l|것|thing}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{ko-IPA}}

===Pronoun===
{{ko-pos|pronoun}} {{qualifier|demonstrative}}

# [[this]]

====Usage notes====
{{ko-l|이것}} can contract to {{ko-l|이거}}. Thus, {{ko-l|이것[[은]]}} can contract to {{ko-l|이건}}, {{ko-l|이것[[이]]}} to {{ko-l|이게}}, {{ko-l|이것[[을]]}} to {{ko-l|이걸}}, and {{ko-l|이것[[으로]]}} to {{ko-l|이걸로}}.

